sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client app
    participant G as API gateway
    participant A as Auth service
    participant O as Order service
    participant P as Payment provider
    participant Q as Message queue
    C->>G: POST /orders with bearer token
    G->>A: Validate token and scopes
    A-->>G: Token valid for customer 42
    G->>O: Create order (customer 42)
    O->>P: Authorize payment of 19.99 EUR
    P-->>O: Authorization id pay_8f2
    O->>Q: Publish OrderCreated event
    O-->>G: 201 Created with order id
    G-->>C: 201 Created
